.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-s3-plans - List Object Storage plans


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro s3 plans [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
List Object Storage plans

.PP
Orderable Object Storage (\fBstandard-*\fR) and Protected Storage (\fBprotected-*\fR) plans with limits, prices per billing cycle (fixed EUR, VAT excluded) and add-ons: extra traffic packs (\fB1tb\fR, \fB5tb\fR, one-time, this calendar month) and object lock buckets (protected plans). \fBavailable: false\fR = no capacity right now.

.PP
API: GET /cloud/storage/plans (operationId listStoragePlans, scope cloud_read)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for plans


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
	API base URL (env GYRO_API_URL)

.PP
